{"name": "Scrapworks Inc.", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/eacbcf6cbdec446b659ba6e99fa712b1.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"618\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick an engineer, bolt scrap onto your chassis and turn toasters, saws and rusty cannons into a machine that hits hard. You plan the build. The robot fights by itself. A short tutorial walks you through your first run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/2175accaea43b3631c4e4d825c45b57f.poster.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/2175accaea43b3631c4e4d825c45b57f.webm?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/2175accaea43b3631c4e4d825c45b57f.mp4?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/456a2b542a1ba474838ed9a3ddca0b0b.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"546\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate and mirror parts so they power each other. Where you bolt a part matters as much as what it is. Tier them up from I to IV to make them stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/872a922a798574151d0a0f74e2ceee26.poster.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/872a922a798574151d0a0f74e2ceee26.webm?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/872a922a798574151d0a0f74e2ceee26.mp4?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/b5b4179b537a62590e710e661b95176e.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"570\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your machine takes on the builds of other players in asynchronous PvP, so there's no queue. Reach 10 wins before you run out of chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/aa9a5ba0f2b324fb9bdc7ee1d660bda5.poster.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/aa9a5ba0f2b324fb9bdc7ee1d660bda5.webm?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/aa9a5ba0f2b324fb9bdc7ee1d660bda5.mp4?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/219ae287932c86d4b5c3fa74bf8d710d.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"448\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play casual with no pressure, or go ranked and climb from Scrap through Iron, Copper, Steel and Titanium to Workshop Legend. Every season starts fresh, and your final rank stays as an insignia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras_big/6afe5a1a4a9f4ed37eab9d91b94eea60.webp?t=1792723607\" height=\"382\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/6afe5a1a4a9f4ed37eab9d91b94eea60.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/5618e23dc2729e757a2b96a5fb2bc82c.poster.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/5618e23dc2729e757a2b96a5fb2bc82c.webm?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/5618e23dc2729e757a2b96a5fb2bc82c.mp4?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/e1f4e0b63e577bc1d0eaf02a4667bc53.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"658\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between fights, supplier vans, roadside events and odd jobs help you improve your machine. Along the way the mechanic's van rolls in: hand it one of your parts and it comes back modified. Every run plays out differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/a715556170ef49271d8956cd5cd15833.poster.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/a715556170ef49271d8956cd5cd15833.webm?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/a715556170ef49271d8956cd5cd15833.mp4?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"86\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/217966c1f08794456cf6d21c006748f8.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"658\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">150+ parts, 60+ trinkets, 100+ talents and 5 engineers with their own playstyle: Dona Durep\u00f3xi, Nina \"Dr. Rust\", Professor Repetilda, Tonico Jumpstart and Z\u00e9 Sledgehammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/3fb5857a4089471cc22a2d50fc5858e4.poster.avif?t=1792723607\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/3fb5857a4089471cc22a2d50fc5858e4.webm?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/extras/3fb5857a4089471cc22a2d50fc5858e4.mp4?t=1792723607\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A PvP auto battler built from junk. Buy scrap parts, wire them together on a grid and tier them up, then watch your machine fight other players' builds on its own.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5426550/c0094e2daa54f08c2b4471b2e9a38b5e504fbffa/header.jpg?t=1792723607", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Roguelike", "Roguelite", "PvP", "Asynchronous Multiplayer"], "developers": "betobullet", "publishers": "betobullet", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5426550", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Zs8BrrT-V_w", "first_seen": 1792706400.0, "review_rank": 13}